            cand validate-amendment 'Validate a protocol amendment'
            cand evaluate-governance 'Evaluate a data-handling request against institutional policy'
            cand workflow 'Print the conservative agent workflow policy'
            cand help 'Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)'
